          "Title": "Home",
          "Commands": [],
          "Columns": [],
          "Show status": true,
          "About": [
            {
              "Heading": "WELCOME",
              "Lines": [
                {
                  "Text": "• Nightshade is a cozy-but-feral solo/duo server. Max team size is 2.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• The week is PvE. PvP weekend is Friday 8:00 PM to Monday 3:00 AM Eastern.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Purge is Tuesday of wipe week at 2:00 PM Eastern until the Thursday wipe. Serverwide FAFO.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Monuments and events are always PvP.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Vanilla gathering on resources, components, and food.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• 10x+ stack sizes, with exceptions for balance.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Monthly wipe: first Thursday at 2:00 PM Eastern, unless Discord says otherwise.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Custom progression through /shop, Skill Tree, events, and VIP perks.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Event loot is public. Hacked crates, supply drops, and heli or Bradley crates are not locked.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Base boxes stay yours. Sleeping players stay protected.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Heading": "WHERE TO START",
              "Lines": [
                {
                  "Text": "• Rules has the full list. Discord has the invite and a QR code.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                },
                {
                  "Text": "• Commands is next. /shop is there when you want to spend RP.",
                  "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
