      "Tabs": [
        {
          "Title": "Systems",
          "Commands": [],
          "Columns": [
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "ECONOMY",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "• /shop opens the RP shop. /store does the same.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• RP is the player currency. It is ServerRewards points.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Activity rewards pay RP. Economics is turned off.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• The Admin Shop tab trades items for Blood. It is not a second cash shop.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• There is no separate Black Market currency.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Your RP on Home comes from ServerRewards. If it does not answer, it shows -.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Heading": "LOOT PROTECTION",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "• Boxes, furnaces, and TC storage: you, your teammate, or TC auth. /share opens one container for someone else.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Sleeping players stay unlootable all week, including PvP weekend and Purge. Teammates can still loot them.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Event loot is open to anyone and is not locked.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Hacked crates, supply drops, and heli or Bradley crates from events are public.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Purge does not turn base storage or sleeper protection off. A PvP monument does not either.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Domes only show over events, not monuments.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "muted"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "PROGRESSION",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "• Skill Tree unlocks long-term bonuses. /skills, /skilltree, or /st.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Heading": "VEHICLES",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "• Car chassis are buyable with RP from /shop.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• Build a purchased chassis at the car lift.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• 4-module chassis are in the VIP shop.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• /tug or /tugboat is the tugboat license.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "• ChestStacks: 3 stacks for non-VIP, 5 stacks for VIP.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
